WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
In a separate laboratory recording, a G1 robot steps forward and begins lowering its torso toward a padded incline. Its safety tether, gantry and operator remain visible.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.800
The robot bends deeply and brings its hand and tool near the padded surface. This silent selected movement ends before later motion and does not show the complete trial outcome.
